globs: apps/ux/**/*.html
---

# OneOhm V2 — Design Tokens

> **Compact. Consistent. Never generic.**

---

## 📐 Layout

| Element | Size |
|---------|------|
| Header | 48px |
| Rail | 48px |
| Panel | 200px |
| Padding | 16px (p-4) |

---

## 🔤 Typography

| Use | Class |
|-----|-------|
| Body | `text-[13px]` |
| Label | `text-[13px] font-medium` |
| Title | `text-[15px] font-semibold` |
| Badge | `text-[11px] font-medium` |

**❌ Never font-bold**

---

## 🎨 Visual

| Property | Use | Avoid |
|----------|-----|-------|
| Border | `border-gray-100` | gray-200 |
| Radius | `rounded-lg` | xl/2xl |
| Shadow | `shadow-sm` | md+ |
| Padding | `p-4` | p-5/6 |

---

## 📊 Tables

```
Row: py-2 (44px)
Header: text-[11px] font-medium text-gray-500
Cell: text-[13px]
Hover: hover:bg-gray-50
```

---

## 🏷️ Badge

```html
<span class="text-[11px] font-medium px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-green-50 text-green-700">
  Active
</span>
```
